        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Milk of magnesia, also known as magnesium hydroxide, is generally considered safe to use during pregnancy to ease constipation, but you should always ask your doctor before taking it. In addition to helping relieve symptoms of constipation, milk of magnesia may help with muscle cramps, says Kimberly Langdon, OB/GYN and medical advisor at Medzino Health.",
