        "text": "Ginger is not only helpful for morning sickness ; it's also incredibly soothing on the stomach and may calm nausea, soothe sore muscles and reduce muscle soreness. If you have an upset tummy associated with constipation, ginger tea might help. This ginger tea by Yogi is certified organic, non-GMO and caffeine-free.",
